    "notes": "Original editor/sidebar backgrounds are identical and preserved. List state alpha is composited over that original canvas; editor selection is calibrated to the original visible result at Typie's fixed 30% alpha. Accent uses the original link/progress color because Typie shares it with primary actions. Secondary text receives limited lightness adjustments for dashboard readability. Search/comments stay amber, review issues purple and strengths teal. Additional editor hues follow source chroma with ordered hue positions."
